# Legacy reference source — not part of this repo.
# Upstream: https://github.com/w0eeemst/YONIQ
# Spec documents reference it by relative path (e.g. `cradio.cpp`) assuming a local
# clone at yoniq-old/YONIQ-main/ for convenience during development; it is intentionally
# gitignored, not tracked, per LICENSES.md.
yoniq-old/
QSSTV-main/
# Hamlib reference source — https://github.com/Hamlib/Hamlib — a local clone at hamlib/ lets specs
# and implementation verify rigctld's real wire grammar against source instead of prose (spec/04-
# rigctld.md); reference only, never vendored/compiled into Scanline Studio, gitignored, never committed.
hamlib/
# flrig reference source — https://github.com/w1hkj/flrig — a local clone at flrig/ lets the flrig
# XML-RPC client backend verify its wire protocol (src/server/xml_server.cxx) against source instead
# of prose/docs (which disagree with source on some formatting); reference only, never vendored/
# compiled into Scanline Studio, gitignored, never committed.
flrig/
# Local Claude Code settings — machine/session-specific, not shared project config.
.claude/settings.local.json

# Claude Code project instructions and session-resume scratch file — kept local, not tracked
# (removed from all prior history 2026-08-13, see backup-pre-history-rewrite-20260813 on origin).
CLAUDE.md
PROJECT_BRIEF.md
astra-audit.md

# Codex CLI's equivalent local files — same reasoning as CLAUDE.md above.
.codex/
AGENTS.md

# .NET build output
bin/
obj/
out/
artifacts/
*.user
*.suo
.vs/

# Test/coverage output
TestResults/
coverage-results/
coverage*.json
coverage*.xml
coverage*.info
# Checked-in CI coverage-gate config (spec/18-path-to-1.0.md), not test output -- would otherwise
# be silently caught by coverage*.json above.
!coverage-thresholds.json

# UI design-mockup working files (screenshots, zips, scratch layout exports) -- not build inputs.
# Untracked and purged from remote history 2026-09-20 (see backup-pre-mockups-purge-20260920 on
# origin for the pre-purge state); kept locally, just not version-controlled.
mockups/

# Project documentation and architecture specs -- untracked and purged from remote history
# 2026-09-20 by explicit user request (see backup-pre-mockups-purge-20260920 on origin for the
# pre-purge state). Kept locally, just not version-controlled. Note: docs/help/ is still glob-
# included into ScanlineStudio.Host.csproj's build output, and CLAUDE.md/spec/ still cite these
# files by path -- both now assume a local checkout, not a fresh clone.
docs/
spec/

# OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Python bytecode cache (any Python dev tooling)
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Manually-captured over-the-air recordings for RX decode testing/improvement -- not
# build inputs, not licensed for the repo, kept local only.
/ota-recordings/

# Regeneratable synthetic decode-quality sweep reports (ImpairmentSweepHarness) -- not build inputs,
# not source data, kept local only.
/impairment-reports/

# User-supplied OTA captures and decodes -- local only, never committed (same posture as
# ota-recordings/ and the HF noise corpus).
tests/test/

# The user's real Windows MMSSTV install (settings, personal templates carrying a real callsign,
# the licensed MMSSTV.EXE binary) -- personal data and third-party licensed content, never
# committed, same posture as yoniq-old/ above.
MMSSTV/
